  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Enga Landslide 2024 - ADF Humanitarian Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 24 May 2024 a landslide in Enga Province, Papua New Guinea caused multiple deaths and affected as many as 8,000 people. This investment reflects the ODA-eligible elements of the Australian Defence Force humanitarian support for the PNG Government&#x2019;s response efforts. The ADF worked closely with the PNG Defence Force and other PNG Government agencies to provide logistical support, including transporting emergency responders, and delivering over 115 tonnes of emergency relief supplies including shelter and hygiene kits.</narrative>
  </description>
